id: pm-csv-76cu
title: Make legacy CSV importer accept file input and native flags
description: "The generated csv-import import command rejects file operands and exits successfully without input. Share the native import contract and implementation; prove real CLI behavior in a non-git tracker, dry-run immutability and behavioral revert."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-20T09:59:03.042Z"
