comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-20T09:59:17.341Z",codex-agent,"Confirmed registerImporter creates the csv-import import command. The pinned SDK supports arguments and flags through its third ImportExportRegistrationOptions parameter and forwards args. Choose shared native command metadata and handler, retaining options.file for configured callers. No host limitation forces refusal. Add real CLI regressions without git, snapshot dry-run writes, and prove failure with the importer adapter reverted."
  "2026-10-20T10:02:52.097Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: kept native command and all tests, restored only the old registerImporter adapter, rebuilt dist, then node --test test/legacy-import-cli.test.ts failed (1 test, 0 pass, 1 fail): the preview produced undefined instead of a native JSON preview. Restored the shared adapter. Linked real CLI test previously passed 1/1 without git; snapshots cover durable tracker state and exclude disposable host runtime read caches."
  "2026-10-20T10:24:37.554Z",codex-agent,"Implementation, README command table and Without git section are complete. Full npm release gate is progressing through existing atomic recovery tests at unchanged thresholds. A repeated linked CLI run hit the default 120-second runner timeout under shared-host contention; the earlier isolated run passed, and the final linked run will use a longer runner timeout. No timeout is counted as approval."
