  "2026-10-20T10:55:26.430Z",codex-agent,"The full CI-identity reproduction passed with an isolated HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1: npm run release:check, 286/286 tests, 0 fail/skip/cancel/todo, configured coverage 100/100/100 and all three packed-consumer scenarios. All final changelog/provenance/date checks passed. bun run release:check is now running on unchanged code."
  "2026-10-20T11:12:29.856Z",codex-agent,"Final verification complete: npm run release:check, the full isolated Git-identity reproduction, and bun run release:check each passed 286/286 tests with 0 failures/skips/cancellations/todo, configured 100/100/100 coverage unchanged, all 3 packed acceptance scenarios and all release checks. Final linked run: pm test pm-csv-76cu --run --progress --timeout 600 passed 1/1 in 47 seconds. Real CLI previews/refusals preserve durable tracker bytes without git. Revert proof is recorded above. No known implementation risk or host input-contract limitation remains; release claim for review without closing the item."
